    "text": "Equation of motion for slider: <br/><math><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>  <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>  <br/>Comparing with <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>.</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>  <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mo>;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></math>  <br/>We know: <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msup></math>  <br/>For amplitude to be <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>,</mo></math>  <br/><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>  <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10,000</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></math>  <br/>Time period = <math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><